# content/ IS committed. The garden is self-contained: a fresh clone builds
# without the vault or ironledger present. ./sync.sh refreshes content from the
# vault — review what it changed and commit it.
#
# Do not list content/ here even if that ever changes. Quartz honors .gitignore
# when it discovers content, so ignoring the folder would make the build skip
# the entire site rather than merely leaving it out of git.
